1
00:02:10,357 --> 00:02:12,940
Ruby
Ruby

2
00:02:16,315 --> 00:02:17,232
你在做什么?
What are you doing?

3
00:02:19,024 --> 00:02:21,440
你刚刚为什么要那样凶大家呀?
Why did you shout at everyone like that?

4
00:02:25,274 --> 00:02:27,315
我在哪?
Where am I?

5
00:02:28,107 --> 00:02:30,357
没事的 我可以找到回去的路
It's okay, I can guide us back.

6
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:32,357
但你真的不该逃跑的
You shouldn't run off though.

7
00:02:32,899 --> 00:02:35,399
想回家的话 大家团结在一起才是最好的
You all need to stick together if you want to go home.

8
00:02:38,315 --> 00:02:39,899
你怎么还在这?
Why are you still here?

9
00:02:41,024 --> 00:02:42,065
呃 你说什么?
Uh... What?

10
00:02:42,899 --> 00:02:43,732
我承诺过的
I promised.

11
00:02:44,857 --> 00:02:47,024
我也承诺过要成为猎人 为擎天效力
I promised to serve Atlas as a Huntress.

12
00:02:47,899 --> 00:02:49,357
承诺过要保护人们的安全
That I'd keep people safe.

13
00:02:50,274 --> 00:02:51,982
承诺过我会支持我的朋友
That I'd be there for my friends.

14
00:02:52,815 --> 00:02:55,149
但是 我们还能回去 然后...
But, we can go back and...

15
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:55,440
不能了!
No!

16
00:02:56,690 --> 00:02:58,774
你不知道我做过什么
You don't know what I've done.

17
00:02:58,857 --> 00:03:00,440
我没能做到些什么
What I couldn't do.

18
00:03:01,357 --> 00:03:02,690
我做不到了!
I can't do this!

19
00:03:04,232 --> 00:03:06,190
我永远都做不到
I could never do this.

20
00:03:08,565 --> 00:03:12,149
如果你继续跟我在一起 你也会死的
If you stay with me, you're going to end up dead too.

21
00:03:14,899 --> 00:03:17,357
回家吧
Just go home.

22
00:03:18,940 --> 00:03:19,690
但是你...
But you're....

23
00:03:19,732 --> 00:03:21,149
我叫你回去!
said go!

24
00:04:29,149 --> 00:04:30,357
这是怎么回事?
What is this?

25
00:04:33,565 --> 00:04:34,357
你好啊 小红
Hello, Red.

26
00:04:36,774 --> 00:04:37,565
好久不见了
Been a while.

27
00:04:37,982 --> 00:04:39,524
英雄之路感觉如何呀?
How's the hero biz treatin' ya?

28
00:04:40,357 --> 00:04:43,274
咱就是说 你看起来可不怎么好
I gotta say, you're not lookin' too good.

29
00:04:44,107 --> 00:04:45,274
妮奥在哪?
Where's Neo?

30
00:04:46,690 --> 00:04:47,774
真没礼貌!
No manners!

31
00:04:48,232 --> 00:04:51,315
明明大家都是来看你的!
And after everyone came out to see you!

32
00:04:58,065 --> 00:05:00,565
向你问好 Ruby!
Salutations, Ruby!

33
00:05:00,607 --> 00:05:01,982
又见面了
Hello again.

34
00:05:02,274 --> 00:05:03,732
Rose小姐
Miss Rose.

35
00:05:03,774 --> 00:05:04,982
请坐吧
Why don't you take a seat.

36
00:05:06,024 --> 00:05:08,274
她是怎么做到的?
How is she doing this?

37
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:13,815
停下! 这都是幻像!
Stop it! This isn't real!

38
00:05:13,982 --> 00:05:14,899
幻像?
Isn't real?

39
00:05:15,232 --> 00:05:19,065
可你才是那个跟着一只会说话的猫咪闯荡童话故事的人啊
You're the one following a talking cat around a fairytale.

40
00:05:20,565 --> 00:05:23,649
现实的界限每分每秒在模糊哦 孩子
Reality's getting fuzzier by the minute, kid.

41
00:05:28,774 --> 00:05:33,482
你知道吗 自从妮奥意识到自己的处境后 一切都变了
Y'know, once Neo realized where she was, everything changed.

42
00:05:33,774 --> 00:05:36,774
她一直都很想 ‘有一个能逃离现实的地方’
Always loved the idea of a place to run away from it all.

43
00:05:37,649 --> 00:05:39,857
可以做任何自己想做的事
Do whatever you want.

44
00:05:42,107 --> 00:05:44,357
在树??子时我也为她提供过这么个所在
I offered that to her back on Remnant.

45
00:05:47,065 --> 00:05:49,565
但结局我们都很清楚
But we all remember how that ended.

46
00:05:50,357 --> 00:05:53,065
这真的是你的目的吗?
Is that seriously what this is all about?

47
00:05:53,649 --> 00:05:56,857
你还是把罗曼死去的事情怪在我头上?
You still blame me for what happened to Torchwick?

48
00:05:58,232 --> 00:06:01,607
如果你想要我道歉的话 你就是在浪费时间
If you're looking for an apology, you've wasted your time.

49
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:08,190
有人说大家都觉得自己是自己故事中的英雄
They say everyone thinks they are the hero of their own story.

50
00:06:09,149 --> 00:06:11,815
但是 我很清楚我是什么货色
But, I knew what I was.

51
00:06:12,482 --> 00:06:16,232
在你内心深处 我想你也很清楚你自己是什么样子
And deep down, I think you know what you are too.

52
00:06:21,774 --> 00:06:23,149
圣树的叶子?
The leaves from the tree?

53
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:25,357
哎呀 你认得呀!
Oh, you're familiar!

54
00:06:26,274 --> 00:06:27,732
要不要重置一下?
How about a little reset?

55
00:06:28,315 --> 00:06:29,440
这就是你想要的?
Is that what you want?

56
00:06:30,149 --> 00:06:32,774
如果你想要我死的话 那你来杀我啊
Well, if you want me dead then come get me.

57
00:06:32,899 --> 00:06:37,815
哈哈哈 小红 你不配去死
Hahaha, you don't deserve to die, Red.

58
00:06:38,274 --> 00:06:40,649
你应该被瓦解
You deserve to be broken down.

59
00:06:41,149 --> 00:06:42,440
拆散
Torn apart.

60
00:06:43,565 --> 00:06:45,982
把你的存在从这世抹去
Wiped from existence.

61
00:06:57,315 --> 00:07:01,190
我会享受看到你被撕碎的样子
I'm going to enjoy watching you break.

62
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:05,107
Ruby!
Ruby!

63
00:07:05,232 --> 00:07:06,024
Ruby!
Ruby!

64
00:07:07,690 --> 00:07:08,482
Ruby?
Ruby?

65
00:07:09,649 --> 00:07:10,190
可恶!
Damn it!

66
00:07:10,649 --> 00:07:12,274
她怎么可以就那样跑掉?
How could she just run off like that?

67
00:07:12,732 --> 00:07:14,190
她明显很不高兴
She was clearly upset.

68
00:07:14,649 --> 00:07:16,190
那不是什么不高兴了 那是..
That wasn't upset, that was...

69
00:07:16,815 --> 00:07:17,315
呃啊!
Ugh!

70
00:07:17,857 --> 00:07:19,649
她本来可以跟我们谈谈的
She could've just talked to us.

71
00:07:20,065 --> 00:07:22,065
可能她觉得她没办法跟我们谈吧
Maybe she didn't feel like she could.

72
00:07:24,274 --> 00:07:27,440
在最困难的时候 一直是Ruby带领我们闯过难关
Ruby has always been the one to get us through the hard times.

73
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:33,065
我们总是说着像「我们相信你! 都靠你了!」之类的话
We say things like - We believe in you! We can count on you!

74
00:07:33,857 --> 00:07:36,857
虽然我们是好意 但是..
I know we mean well, but...

75
00:07:38,065 --> 00:07:40,857
我们并没有要求她做个完人啊
It's not like we're asking her to be perfect.

76
00:07:48,607 --> 00:07:51,065
你以为你是谁 还觉得自己知道什么对擎天最好?
Who were you to think you knew what was best for Atlas?

77
00:07:51,107 --> 00:07:54,565
我是信标最棒最聪明的学生
I was the best and brightest Beacon had to offer.

78
00:07:55,399 --> 00:08:00,274
我用我的命作为代价 让我的朋友们能活下去
I traded my life so that my friends could live.

79
00:08:09,732 --> 00:08:14,024
就像你在维特节上迟了一步 没能救我一样
Just like you were too late to save me at the Vital festival.

80
00:08:15,607 --> 00:08:19,440
我也死在了擎天 不是吗?
Idied in Atlas, too, didn't I?

81
00:08:22,107 --> 00:08:25,732
你能想象我当时的心情吗?
Can you imagine what that's like?

82
00:08:27,274 --> 00:08:36,690
被一个你视为全世界最重要的人 一次又一次地辜负
To be completely, and utterly failed, time and again, by someone who meant the world to you.

83
00:08:39,274 --> 00:08:41,315
准备好喝下那杯饮料了吗?
You ready for that drink yet?

84
00:08:43,482 --> 00:08:47,524
还要有多少人因你而死?
How many more people are going to die because of you?

85
00:08:48,857 --> 00:08:51,524
我只是想要拯救大家
I'm trying to save everyone.

86
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:54,690
但是呢 即使有再好的初衷
And yet, with all your best intentions, have you ever stopped to wonder if you've done more harm than good?

87
00:08:54,732 --> 00:08:57,940
你有没有停下来好好想过你是不是带来了更多的灾难 而非希望?
And yet, with all your best intentions, have you ever stopped to wonder if you've done more harm than good?

88
00:09:00,065 --> 00:09:02,024
不是我的错...
It's not my fault...

89
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:06,607
你还要毁掉多少生命才能醒悟
How many more lives do you have to ruin before you realize

90
00:09:06,649 --> 00:09:10,940
你就不是拯救别人的这块料!
you're not cutout to save anyone!

91
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:11,690
不要!
No!

92
00:09:19,524 --> 00:09:20,190
Ruby.
Ruby...

93
00:09:31,732 --> 00:09:36,357
你真的觉得你还能继续看着你的朋友们一个个倒下吗?
Do you really think you can stand to watch more of your friends fall?

94
00:09:36,565 --> 00:09:38,190
求求你 停下…
Please stop...

95
00:09:38,315 --> 00:09:40,649
还是说你准备好接受现实了呢?
Or are you ready to admit the truth?

96
00:09:41,190 --> 00:09:44,399
接受这个世界没有你或许会更好的这件事?
That the world would just be better off without you?

97
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:22,482
没事了Ruby 都结束了
It's alright, Ruby. It's over now.

98
00:10:23,065 --> 00:10:31,399
对不起 我只是不想再做我自己了...
I'm sorry, I don't want to be me anymore...

99
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:36,232
没事的 小猎人呀
It's okay, little Huntress.

100
00:10:37,274 --> 00:10:40,357
我可以成为你
I can be you instead.

101
00:10:42,107 --> 00:10:46,107
我一直在试图击溃你的内心啊
I have been trying to wear you down for so long.

102
00:10:49,190 --> 00:10:50,982
你在做什么?
What are you doing?

103
00:10:52,024 --> 00:10:53,274
我的意义
My purpose.

104
00:10:53,899 --> 00:10:58,357
当一颗可怜的心碎掉时 我会用我的心将它填补起来
When a poor little heart is broken, I can fill it with mine.

105
00:10:58,815 --> 00:11:03,065
我恐怕并没有完全跟你说实话 Ruby
I'm afraid I haven't been entirely honest with you, Ruby.

106
00:11:03,857 --> 00:11:06,565
我跟其他的仙境居民不同
I'm not like the other Afterans here.

107
00:11:06,690 --> 00:11:09,482
我被赋予了名为好奇的诅咒
I'm cursed with curiosity.

108
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:12,357
我需要知道一切!
I need to know everything!

109
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,065
但 比任何事都重要的是
But more than anything, I need to know why my maker has left me here, only to leave and to make all of Owww!

110
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:17,774
我需要知道我的创造者为什么把我扔在了这里
But more than anything, I need to know why my maker has left me here, only to leave and to make all of - Owww!

111
00:11:18,065 --> 00:11:22,857
仅仅是为了 啊啊!
But more than anything, need to know why my maker has left me here, only to leave and to make all of - Owww!

112
00:11:24,065 --> 00:11:25,565
你不是朋友!
You're not a friend!

113
00:11:25,607 --> 00:11:27,607
朋友不会 啊啊啊..
Friends don't -- Aghh...

114
00:11:39,107 --> 00:11:40,107
Ruby!
Ruby!

115
00:11:43,315 --> 00:11:44,690
你得起来了!
You have to get up!

116
00:11:45,315 --> 00:11:46,857
我们该走了!
We have to go!

117
00:11:56,857 --> 00:12:00,482
是时候让大家都迎来应得的结局了
I think it's about time we all got what we deserve.

118
00:12:11,315 --> 00:12:13,482
你准备好接受现实了吗?
Are you ready to admit the truth?

119
00:12:16,732 --> 00:12:19,732
接受这个世界没有你或许会更好的这件事?
That the world would just be better off without you?

120
00:12:30,607 --> 00:12:31,357
Ruby?
Ruby?

121
00:12:40,232 --> 00:12:41,940
你终于做到了!
You've finally done it!

122
00:12:43,732 --> 00:12:45,190
小红不在了
Little Red's gone.

123
00:12:46,107 --> 00:12:51,399
现在 你的外像力比以往都要强 我们可以占领这个荒谬的地方!
With your semblance stronger than ever now, we could take over this whole absurd place!

124
00:12:53,690 --> 00:12:54,565
为什么不要?
Why not?

125
00:12:55,607 --> 00:12:58,357
结束掉小红不可能是你唯一的心愿啊
Offing Little Red can't be all you wanted.

126
00:12:59,899 --> 00:13:00,440
对吧?
Right?

127
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:09,732
不 不 不 不!
No, no, no, no!

128
00:13:10,024 --> 00:13:11,315
我还需要她!
I needed her!

129
00:13:24,315 --> 00:13:25,607
带我们去找她
Take us to her.

130
00:13:25,857 --> 00:13:28,857
你还是不明白啊?
You still don't get it, do you?

131
00:13:29,732 --> 00:13:34,024
那不是一个你能「去」的地方 而是一个你「知道」的地方
It's not a place you go, it's a place you know.

132
00:13:35,524 --> 00:13:36,649
不过无所谓了..
But no matter...

133
00:13:37,190 --> 00:13:41,690
我的问题有了个更好的解决方案
I've actually found a much better solution to my problem.

134
00:13:59,524 --> 00:14:02,982
你已经失去了你最重要的东西了 对吧
You've lost something most important, haven't you.

135
00:14:04,232 --> 00:14:06,690
那么现在 你什么都不剩了
And now, you have nothing left.

136
00:14:08,857 --> 00:14:10,857
多么令人愉快啊!
How delightful!

137
00:14:12,357 --> 00:14:17,440
一具可以让我填满的完美空壳!
An empty host, perfect for me to fill!

138
00:14:23,899 --> 00:14:24,565
不!
No!

139
00:14:44,732 --> 00:14:47,774
啊 锈迹骑士!
Ah... The Rusted Knight!

140
00:14:48,565 --> 00:14:52,815
真是的 我已经烦透你的支线故事了
Goodness, am I tired of your little sub-story.

141
00:14:55,107 --> 00:14:59,607
你甚至无法接受自己的无能
You can't even accept your own futility.

142
00:15:02,565 --> 00:15:05,149
这具身体足够用了
This body will do.